{"id":"da07ff2a202c70c4","group":"93","path":"93/93-ex-locally-finite.md","title":"Locally Finite","display":"Locally Finite","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-ex-locally-finite","aliases":["93-ex-locally-finite"],"display":"Locally Finite","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-fcp]]","[[93-df-locally-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-ex-locally-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-ex-locally-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Locally Finite"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e8be33143821f05\" href=\"?note=0e8be33143821f05\" title=\"93-df-fcp\">93-df-fcp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c9464b912634e40b\" href=\"?note=c9464b912634e40b\" title=\"93-df-locally-finite\">93-df-locally-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"ex-locally-finite---Locally-Finite\">ex-locally-finite - Locally Finite</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced Boolean signature and Boolean-algebra predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed variety predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\">\\(\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\)</span> is the Boolean variety defined below, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}_{\\mathbf B}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}_{\\mathbf B}(X)\\)</span> is its generated-subalgebra constructor.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the local finite-set predicate used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}\\)</span> is the locally-finite-algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c9464b912634e40b\" href=\"?note=c9464b912634e40b\" title=\"93-df-locally-finite\">93-df-locally-finite</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93};\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\forall X\\in[|\\mathbf B|]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}_{\\mathbf B}(X)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93};\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\forall X\\in[|\\mathbf B|]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}_{\\mathbf B}(X)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>A Boolean subalgebra generated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> elements has at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{2^r}\">\\(2^{2^r}\\)</span>\nelements, so every finitely generated subalgebra is finite.  This gives a\nfully internal example without leaving the book's formal vocabulary for an\nunformalized finite-field object.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"ex-locally-finite---Locally-Finite","text":"ex-locally-finite - Locally Finite","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-fcp","status":"resolved","id":"0e8be33143821f05","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-fcp]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-locally-finite","status":"resolved","id":"c9464b912634e40b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-locally-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}$ is the type-indexed variety predicate of [[93-df-variety]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the local finite-set predicate used by [[93-df-finite-subset]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-locally-finite","status":"resolved","id":"c9464b912634e40b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}$ is the locally-finite-algebra predicate of [[93-df-locally-finite]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}_{\\mathbf B}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93};\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathbf B\\in\\mathcal V_{\\mathsf{BA},93}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LocFin}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\forall X\\in[|\\mathbf B|]^{<\\omega}\\;\n\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sg}^{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}_{\\mathbf B}(X)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"2^{2^r}","display":false}],"bytes":1830,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["757a95a2c335d9fb","7087f500cc845c3b","f0b0edbaa6696a1d","6b63f2f43b5511ee","0e8be33143821f05","c9464b912634e40b"]}